 inherently risk averse when selecting infrastructure partners.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/26/marathon-digital-mara-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MARA 2026 Q1","e":"mara","d":"2026-05-11","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Frederick G. Thiel","x":"Available, connected energy is the bottleneck on AI compute growth.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/11/mara-mara-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MARA 2026 Q1","e":"mara","d":"2026-05-11","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Frederick G. Thiel","x":"It will establish a leading AI/HPC data center campus in the PJM Interconnection, one of the most active data center and power markets in North America.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/11/mara-mara-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MARA 2026 Q1","e":"mara","d":"2026-05-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Salman H. Khan","x":"As part of our strategic shift toward AI and critical IT, we have realigned our business operations and reduced workforce by 15%, providing combined annualized savings of $12.0 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/11/mara-mara-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MARA 2026 Q1","e":"mara","d":"2026-05-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Salman H. Khan","x":"In addition, we incurred a restructuring charge of $45.9 million due to elimination of certain business initiatives and realignment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/11/mara-mara-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MARA 2026 Q2","e":"mara","d":"2026-08-06","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Frederick G. Thiel","x":"That is becoming the central infrastructure challenge of the AI era.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/13/mara-mara-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MARA 2026 Q2","e":"mara","d":"2026-08-06","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Frederick G. Thiel","x